MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_001: Hrmm. If it's not one thing, it's another. Sorry, I've\nbeen trying to put out a major business fire.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_002: And the details really need to stay hush-hush. I can't\ntalk much about it.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_003: <NCA>Inquire anyway.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_004: <NCB>Leave him.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_005: <ACA>Heh! Interested, are you? Well, I can appreciate\nthe curiosity.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_006: <ACB>Wait! Maybe hashing it out with you could help me\nsort it all in my head.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_007: See, I tasked a member of my company to transport\nsome goods that were, quote, unquote...dangerous.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_008: But everything has gone missing! The carriage, the\ngoods, the guy, even the guards at his side.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_009: I have to get to the bottom of this...
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_010: Not only would it be a major loss, but in the wrong\nhands, that cargo could become a real problem...
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_011: I need to find out what happened myself, but...your\nskills would surely make things a whole lot easier.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m01_012: What do you think? Feel like helping?
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m03_001: Don't worry about it if you're busy—just know the\ninvitation is open. Come by that place I mentioned.
MID_LGV_SCXX_05_m03_002: Of course, I promise ample compensation. So, give\nit some thought.